### The engine / product boundary (mirrors engine ADR-0052)

This repo is the **PRODUCT**: UI/UX, the product tool surface, orchestration, data-source integrations, guardrails,
and the user loops. The **RAG_Wright ENGINE** (open-core) owns the capabilities, ingestion/query pipelines, MCP
servers, ARD, and the ontology machinery. Dependency is strict and one-way: **Product → Engine.** Never modify the
engine from this repo; flag needed engine changes and make them in the engine project. The product consumes the
engine **only through `rag_wright.api`** and never touches the store (ArcadeDB) directly. Your domain is a `.ttl`
pack + capabilities authored here against the engine; the contract/compliance **reference pack** is only the
engine's worked example — a template, never your domain.

